{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1386920-vampire-travel","id":1386920,"title":"Vampire Travel","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-08T22:49:56-07:00","id":1386920,"title":"Vampire Travel","content":"If you were a Vampire on a budget (you can't get your own private plane, ship, etc.) how would you travel to distant places around the world, if, for example, you had to visit all continents except Antarctica and half the locations were in rural areas far from any cities?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T23:19:18-07:00","id":1386925,"title":"","content":"Traveling over land one of your cheap and relatively safe options is to get a ghoul or two so that you can conceal yourself within the back of the car during the day and have your ghouls carry you anywhere roads that can reach. They should hopefully be competent adults, middle-aged with the resources to afford gas, food for themselves, and to provide the sort of cover that only middle-aged mundanity can provide.<br /> <br /> Traveling cheaply over water is also difficult, but if your willing to pull a Dracula, you can try to ghoul a sailor on a container ship and get yourself settled in somewhere deep and sunproof.<br /> <br /> The easiest way to traverse in such dangerous circumstances is to get reliable ghouls and to fall into a voluntary torpor for the duration of however long the migration might end up taking.<br /> <br /> Ultimately though, whatever resources your kindred have at hand and the abilities of the specific vampire are your best guides to how one might manage to navigate long distances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T03:38:38-07:00","id":1386943,"title":"","content":"Find another vampire who specialises in international shipping and offer them an appropriate boon to arrange transport for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25078-brickman","name":"Brickman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T04:19:24-07:00","id":1386945,"title":"","content":"No less a Camarilla luminary than Victoria Ash pulled the Dracula routine in one of the clan novels, when she was on the run and didn't have her usual access to her resources. <br /> <br /> In practice, the ship captain would have radioed for help once the crew started getting sick or disappearing, though. I can't see it being a plausible recourse in the modern day. Trading a boon for air fare makes much more sense to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T05:16:57-07:00","id":1386953,"title":"","content":"Awesome, thanks. That gives me a better idea of what younger Vampires might do to get around. <br /> <br /> Any supernatural solutions?<br /> <br /> Supernatural or not, how about on the super cheap shoestring budget?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T08:01:55-07:00","id":1386974,"title":"","content":"I think international travel is infrequent for most Kindred. As the world gets smaller with instant communication you may need to go a great distance to escape a bad situation but personally I'd be more inclined to hit South America than Australia if I was fleeing the US. I think a lot of kindred are small potatoes enough to just hit a new state and city. I could see going to Europe or something if you actually plan to relocate long term but flying back and forth isn't a choice I see most vampires taking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T08:22:00-07:00","id":1386977,"title":"","content":"Worth noting is that younger vampires rarely need to jump continents to escape their troubles. They just aren\u2019t important enough yet to need to flee to a different continent to escape the notice of any enemies they\u2019d make.<br /> <br /> As such, get a non-descript car with a trunk (preferably one of the ones you can reach from inside your car), drive at night and park somewhere you\u2019re not likely to be towed during the day (24/7 mega-marts for example) while sleeping in the trunk. You could cross the entire United States in under a week and truck stops and other 24/7 stops for travelers also give you the opportunity to feed if you\u2019re not picky.<br /> <br /> Another option for long distance travel is that people die far from home all the time and need to be shipped back for funerals. Play dead in a coffin while your ghoul arranges transport for a \u201cdear loved one\u201d with an airline and you\u2019ll be able to get to just about anywhere in a day or so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T11:49:53-07:00","id":1387029,"title":"","content":"In real life people sometimes mail themselves from one city to another. <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2003/US/Southwest/09/09/plane.stowaway/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">For example, it happens when one man mailed himself from New York to Texas</a>.<br /> <br /> Vampires who have to travel further than a single night's car drive might do the same thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T11:57:31-07:00","id":1387031,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12480_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12480\" data-vbnamecard=\"12480\">Spacecat</a> these are all good ideas, but honestly, I would just make sure that whoever my mysterious patron was who assigned me this quest gave me a big enough travel budget to do it in relative comfort.<br /> <br /> Problem solved \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T13:06:19-07:00","id":1387055,"title":"","content":"Budget Land Travel for kindred is as simple as a motorcycle and a folded up body bag. Water travel tends to either need ghouls or spending time in a storage container. Though I am reminded of an episode of the Black List where Red had a storage container that should have been on lifestyles of the rich and famous.<br /> <br /> To be fair though it takes remarkably little in the way of points investment to set up a character with access to travel from character generation. I am not talking about just having resources 5, I am referring to the idea that they own/operate a private delivery service, control a local U-Haul center, or operate a limo service. In fact ambitious characters can get quite a lot of boons just by being the go to kindred to get you any where on short notice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T18:40:47-07:00","id":1387147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1386920-vampire-travel?p=1387031#post1387031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> these are all good ideas, but honestly, I would just make sure that whoever my mysterious patron was who assigned me this quest gave me a big enough travel budget to do it in relative comfort.<br /> <br /> Problem solved \ud83d\ude0a</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking more about hypothetical logistics of travel rather than an actual game scenario \ud83d\ude04. Like what if my Vampire had to go to &quot;X&quot; without much help and maybe while being hunted down, sorta thing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T22:12:41-07:00","id":1387180,"title":"","content":"Does having your body stay at home, but sending an Astral Projection count, or is this purely physical travel?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T23:16:01-07:00","id":1387195,"title":"","content":"I'd probably have to be able to do stuff where I go. Lets make this a more concrete scenario.<br /> <br /> I'm a relatively young Vampire. I've spent less than a decade as a Vampire. I live in N.Y.C. I've been learning to save money but I'm not particularly rich yet. I can afford a decent N.Y.C apartment and maintain one. I'm probably a Toreador who was embraced because of good looks, but seem to have developed my disciplines equally, meaning they are all at relatively mediocre levels.<br /> <br /> My Apartment exploded and some hooligans led by a vampire attacked me in my hideout but I managed to escape. I called a Treador friend and he told me not to trust anyone and to get to a safehouse in Philadelphia where there's supposedly cash He hangs up before I can get more than the address and no vampires are answering my calls anymore. I check my bank accounts and one of them isn't working while the other has like $6000.<br /> <br /> Complication 1: A girl I know and love and planned to embrace and spend the rest of my unlife with lives in Palmdale in California and is waiting for me. She's knowledgeable of the Camarilla and I was supposed to go there and turn her into a Vampire next week. I plan to go through with that no matter what. She's not particularly rich either and isn't aswering my calls or messages.<br /> <br /> Complication 2: If I get to Palmdale, I'll discover that the girl left for Madagascar. My sire has a property in Madagascar that she is aware of. We've been there before and the caretakers know to let us inif we show up there.<br /> <br /> Something like that.<br /> <br /> Edit: oh, and there's no Covid for whatever reason. Maybe it's 2015 or 2025.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 05-10-2020, 02:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T07:23:09-07:00","id":1387267,"title":"","content":"You checked your bank accounts so now you are being tracked just atm as much cash as it allows, ditch the cards and get off streets with cameras. Get out of the city and find some average joe who lives alone with few attachments. Too bad about no covid it takes care of work not looking for him or her. &quot;Shelter in place&quot; until the blood bond is formed (since you don't have a 3 presence) have them get as much cash as possible/reasonable and have them drive you to another state and repeat the process on ghoul number 2. The fastest flight from NY to Madagascar seems to be 20 hours so if she went there assume she is dead, the safe house of your friend is not safe, change your name and find you some new love.<br /> <br /> This romantic drivel is why most vampires don't last very long, much like the love the two of you now share will turn to bitter ashes in a few decades anyway when she wants independence as a vampire... Just kidding, but on a serious note if you cant contact anyone the crazy risk is not worth it. Sounds like you just don't have the resources and contacts to make it happen and whatever you did to catch a vampire burn notice is too overwhelming for a Neonate. If you like find someone who speaks Malagasy or more likely French and have them search for her (after blood bond number 3 forms)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T08:09:27-07:00","id":1387273,"title":"","content":"Tracking ATM withdrawals was how the US Army was catching soldiers who went AWOL when I was a clerk 20 years ago. It works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T11:32:30-07:00","id":1387304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vamps Like Us</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1386920-vampire-travel?p=1387267#post1387267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You checked your bank accounts so now you are being tracked just atm as much cash as it allows, ditch the cards and get off streets with cameras. Get out of the city and find some average joe who lives alone with few attachments. Too bad about no covid it takes care of work not looking for him or her. &amp;quot;Shelter in place&amp;quot; until the blood bond is formed (since you don't have a 3 presence) have them get as much cash as possible/reasonable and have them drive you to another state and repeat the process on ghoul number 2. The fastest flight from NY to Madagascar seems to be 20 hours so if she went there assume she is dead, the safe house of your friend is not safe, change your name and find you some new love.<br /> <br /> This romantic drivel is why most vampires don't last very long, much like the love the two of you now share will turn to bitter ashes in a few decades anyway when she wants independence as a vampire... Just kidding, but on a serious note if you cant contact anyone the crazy risk is not worth it. Sounds like you just don't have the resources and contacts to make it happen and whatever you did to catch a vampire burn notice is too overwhelming for a Neonate. If you like find someone who speaks Malagasy or more likely French and have them search for her (after blood bond number 3 forms)</div> </div> </div> </div>@Vamps like us: I like your practical way of thinking <br /> <br /> How hard is it though to get out of the city to the nearest place likely to have ghoul candidate number one? Do i walk there? Would it be better to find a temporary hiding spot and set out after the next sunset?<br /> <br /> So Philadelphia is not safe. Okay cool. So let's say I go out to be a tragic romance hero and go to Palmdale anyway... By ghoul Chaucer service most likely. <br /> <br /> How the hell do I get to Madagascar from there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T12:58:23-07:00","id":1387312,"title":"","content":"The way they've written the second inquistion, going to an airport seems like a generally bad idea, so flying seems like it'd be off limits for most Kindred in V5. It is however possible to get night flights. The movie Only Lovers Left Alive deals with this. You might not be able to get directly to where you want to go and may need multiple flights. For instance one of the main characters books a night flight from Tangiers to Paris, then another the following night to go from Paris to the US. If you do this during the winter, to maximize night time, you can get pretty much anywhere on the planet.<br /> <br /> Edit: Almost forgot, if you're traveling West, it gets much easier because you can stay ahead of the sun. An 8 hour flight from Paris to the US would put you at about the same local time as you left.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14519,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14519-drhappyangry","user":"DrHappyAngry","date":". 05-10-2020, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14519-drhappyangry","name":"DrHappyAngry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14519_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T13:19:25-07:00","id":1387316,"title":"","content":"You want creative ideas for the peniless? <br /> <br /> Ghoul a whale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T13:40:42-07:00","id":1387319,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12480_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12480\" data-vbnamecard=\"12480\">Spacecat</a> Well, I don't know the characters back story or too much about him but I know vampiric society in NY has cut me off and it's probably the only place I have lived as a vampire. Was I born and raised in the city or was I from a suburb of NYC? Since I was embraced for my looks and I assume decent social skills I probably had many friends in high school. I've only been a vampire for a decade and if I was say 23 when I caught my sires eye in a bar I should have lots of possibilities from people I used to be close with that I probably haven't talked to in forever while I was learning the ropes of being undead, thus making them off the radar of the people hunting me. Social media would be my first try to find a candidate, no one married, living with a partner, or kids as I inwardly cursed myself for not focusing on Presence or Dominate and my need to go to someone I could trick persuade or bribe into being my ghoul.<br /> <br /> If I get a guy or girl in their early 30's ghouled through seduction, promise of power, of by fixing them drinks with a little bit of my blood as I crash on the couch, I wait the 3 days and let them drive me out of the city all the way to California where I am determined to go. Unfortunately I'm now in CA where I probably don't know anyone and I honestly have no Idea how to safely get to Madagascar. The fact that they cut me off from my main bank account and probably only left the one with 6k in it to track my purchases I gotta ask, who the hell did I piss off <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T16:17:17-07:00","id":1387358,"title":"","content":"Before they travel they read <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1111207-how-do-vampire-fly\">this thread</a>. It's about travel. Sixty-seven posts of yummy content and discussion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11558-nosimplehiway","name":"Nosimplehiway","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11558_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T22:39:44-07:00","id":1387419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1386920-vampire-travel?p=1387316#post1387316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You want creative ideas for the peniless? <br /> <br /> Ghoul a whale.</div> </div> </div> </div>I \ud83d\ude06 know a guy who's malchavian (I think) PC did this. <br /> <br /> @Vamps like us: Unluckily it's most likely the Vampires sire or an older related Vampire who pissed someone off of the &quot;Kill him and everyone he knows&quot; variety, considering that sort of reaction. <br /> <br /> @Nosimplehiway: Indeed. Awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}